{"seq":2,"slug":"computer-networks","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/computer-networks","wordCount":2102,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学计算机科学与技术-计算机网络\">大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机网络</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>计算机网络是连接世界的基础设施，从互联网到移动通信，从云计算到物联网，几乎所有现代计算都建立在网络之上。理解计算机网络的核心在于掌握<strong>分层架构</strong>的思想——将复杂的端到端通信分解为多个功能层次，每层通过定义良好的接口向上层提供服务。这种分层设计既是工程上的模块化实践，也是管理复杂性的思维框架。</p>\n<p>网络体系结构的两大参考模型是 <strong>OSI 七层模型</strong>和 <strong>TCP/IP 四层模型</strong>。工业实践中 TCP/IP 模型占据主导，但 OSI 模型的分层概念仍是教学和理解网络协议的基石。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TCP/IP 层</th>\n<th>对应 OSI 层</th>\n<th>核心协议</th>\n<th>关键功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>应用/表示/会话</td>\n<td>HTTP, DNS, SMTP, FTP</td>\n<td>用户交互、数据表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TCP, UDP, QUIC</td>\n<td>端到端可靠传输/多路复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>IP, ICMP, BGP, OSPF</td>\n<td>路由寻址、分组转发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链路层</td>\n<td>数据链路/物理</td>\n<td>Ethernet, Wi-Fi, ARP</td>\n<td>帧传输、介质访问控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"应用层协议\">应用层协议</h3><p><strong>HTTP</strong>（HyperText Transfer Protocol）是 Web 的基石。HTTP/1.1 使用持久连接和管道化减少延迟，但存在<strong>队头阻塞</strong>（Head-of-Line Blocking）问题——一个慢响应阻塞同一连接上后续请求。HTTP/2 通过<strong>多路复用</strong>在单一 TCP 连接上并行传输多个流解决了应用层队头阻塞，但 TCP 层的队头阻塞仍然存在。HTTP/3 采用基于 UDP 的 <strong>QUIC</strong> 协议，彻底消除了传输层队头阻塞。</p>\n<p><strong>DNS</strong>（Domain Name System）将域名映射为 IP 地址，采用层次化的分布式数据库架构。域名解析过程从本地缓存出发，依次查询递归解析器、根域名服务器（13 组）、顶级域服务器和权威域名服务器。DNS 查询的典型延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{-}100\\;\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，缓存的 TTL（Time To Live）机制在新鲜度和负载之间取得平衡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传输层-tcp-与拥塞控制\">传输层：TCP 与拥塞控制</h3><p><strong>TCP</strong>（Transmission Control Protocol）提供可靠的、面向连接的字节流服务。其可靠性建立在以下机制之上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三次握手</strong>建立连接：SYN → SYN-ACK → ACK，确保双方的初始序列号（ISN）已交换</li>\n<li><strong>序列号与确认号</strong>：每个字节分配序列号，接收方通过累积确认通知发送方已收到的数据</li>\n<li><strong>超时重传与快速重传</strong>：RTO（Retransmission Timeout）基于 RTT 的指数加权移动平均估计：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SRTT</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>SRTT</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>sample</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SRTT} = (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\text{SRTT} + \\alpha \\cdot \\text{RTT}_{\\text{sample}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SRTT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SRTT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sample</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTO</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>SRTT</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>RTTVAR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTO} = \\text{SRTT} + 4 \\cdot \\text{RTTVAR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SRTT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTTVAR</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/8</span></span></span></span></span>。收到三个重复 ACK 时触发快速重传，无需等待超时。</p>\n<p><strong>TCP 拥塞控制</strong>是网络稳定运行的关键。经典算法包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>窗口变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>慢启动</td>\n<td>每 RTT 窗口翻倍</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cwnd</mtext><mo>←</mo><mtext>cwnd</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cwnd} \\leftarrow \\text{cwnd} \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cwnd</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cwnd</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥塞避免</td>\n<td>每 RTT 窗口加 1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cwnd</mtext><mo>←</mo><mtext>cwnd</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cwnd} \\leftarrow \\text{cwnd} + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cwnd</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cwnd</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速恢复</td>\n<td>3 个重复 ACK 后</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ssthresh</mtext><mo>←</mo><mtext>cwnd</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ssthresh} \\leftarrow \\text{cwnd}/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ssthresh</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cwnd</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TCP 的吞吐量受限于带宽-延迟积（BDP）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BDP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Bandwidth</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>RTT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BDP} = \\text{Bandwidth} \\times \\text{RTT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BDP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bandwidth</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想状态下，发送窗口应等于 BDP。例如，100 Mbps 链路、50 ms RTT 下，BDP = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>625</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>KB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 \\times 10^6 \\times 0.05 / 8 = 625\\;\\text{KB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05/8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">625</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>现代拥塞控制算法 <strong>BBR</strong>（Bottleneck Bandwidth and Round-trip propagation time）由 Google 提出，通过主动探测瓶颈带宽和最小 RTT 来确定发送速率，避免了基于丢包的拥塞信号导致的缓冲膨胀（Bufferbloat）问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络层-ip-与路由\">网络层：IP 与路由</h3><p><strong>IPv4</strong> 地址为 32 位，使用 CIDR（无类别域间路由）表示法，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>192.168.1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">192.168.1.0/24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">192.168.1.0/24</span></span></span></span></span> 表示前 24 位为网络前缀。子网掩码决定了网络部分和主机部分的划分。IPv4 地址空间已耗尽，<strong>IPv6</strong> 将地址扩展到 128 位（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>38</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{128} \\approx 3.4 \\times 10^{38}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">38</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>路由算法</strong>决定分组从源到目的地的转发路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>距离向量算法</strong>（如 RIP）：每个路由器维护到所有目的地的距离和下一跳，周期性与邻居交换路由表。收敛慢，存在<strong>计数到无穷</strong>问题。</li>\n<li><strong>链路状态算法</strong>（如 OSPF）：每个路由器通过泛洪获取全局拓扑，本地运行 Dijkstra 算法计算最短路径树。收敛快但状态信息量大。</li>\n<li><strong>路径向量算法</strong>（如 BGP）：互联网域间路由协议，携带完整 AS 路径防止环路，基于策略（而非最短路径）做路由决策。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>NAT</strong>（网络地址转换）通过在网关处翻译内网地址和端口，让多台主机共享一个公网 IP。NAT 打破了端到端原则，但在 IPv4 地址紧缺的现实中不可或缺。</p>\n<h3 id=\"链路层与局域网\">链路层与局域网</h3><p><strong>以太网</strong>（Ethernet）是最广泛使用的局域网技术。现代交换式以太网使用<strong>交换机</strong>（Switch）替代了早期的集线器和总线，每个端口独占带宽，通过 MAC 地址表实现帧的定向转发。</p>\n<p><strong>ARP</strong>（Address Resolution Protocol）将 IP 地址解析为 MAC 地址。当主机需要发送帧到同一子网内的目的 IP 时，先查询本地 ARP 缓存，未命中则广播 ARP 请求。</p>\n<p><strong>Wi-Fi</strong>（IEEE 802.11）使用 <strong>CSMA/CA</strong>（带冲突避免的载波侦听多路访问）协议：发送前先侦听信道，空闲则等待随机退避时间再发送。无线环境中无法检测冲突（隐藏终端问题），因此使用 RTS/CTS 握手机制预约信道。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络安全基础\">网络安全基础</h3><p><strong>TLS</strong>（Transport Layer Security）在传输层之上提供加密、认证和完整性保护。TLS 1.3 将握手简化为 1-RTT（首次连接）或 0-RTT（恢复连接），大幅减少了延迟。握手过程使用 <strong>Diffie-Hellman 密钥交换</strong>协商会话密钥：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">←</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Alice</mtext></mpadded></mover><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Bob</mtext></mpadded></mover><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^a \\bmod p \\xleftarrow{\\text{Alice}} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Bob}} g^b \\bmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3025em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Alice</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M400000 241H110l3-3c68.7-52.7 113.7-120\n 135-202 4-14.7 6-23 6-25 0-7.3-7-11-21-11-8 0-13.2.8-15.5 2.5-2.3 1.7-4.2 5.8\n-5.5 12.5-1.3 4.7-2.7 10.3-4 17-12 48.7-34.8 92-68.5 130S65.3 228.3 18 247\nc-10 4-16 7.7-18 11 0 8.7 6 14.3 18 17 47.3 18.7 87.8 47 121.5 85S196 441.3 208\n 490c.7 2 1.3 5 2 9s1.2 6.7 1.5 8c.3 1.3 1 3.3 2 6s2.2 4.5 3.5 5.5c1.3 1 3.3\n 1.8 6 2.5s6 1 10 1c14 0 21-3.7 21-11 0-2-2-10.3-6-25-20-79.3-65-146.7-135-202\n l-3-3h399890zM100 241v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Bob</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>双方各自计算共享密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = g^{ab} \\bmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，无需在网络上传输密钥本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>假设 TCP 连接的 RTT 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\;\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，初始 cwnd 为 1 MSS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1460</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1460</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1460</span></span></span></span></span> 字节），慢启动阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>KB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\;\\text{KB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。计算从连接建立到拥塞窗口首次达到慢启动阈值所需的时间。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个组织获得了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200.10.0.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200.10.0.0/21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200.10.0.0/21</span></span></span></span></span> 的 IP 地址块。请计算该块包含多少个可用主机地址。如果要将其划分为 4 个等大的子网，每个子网的 CIDR 表示是什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么 HTTP/2 的多路复用仍然受到 TCP 队头阻塞的影响。QUIC 协议如何通过在 UDP 之上实现独立流来解决这个问题？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较距离向量路由和链路状态路由在收敛速度、带宽消耗和实现复杂度方面的差异。在一个有 100 个路由器的网络中，哪种算法更适合？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在公共 Wi-Fi 网络中，即使使用了 HTTPS，攻击者仍然可以获取哪些信息？请从 DNS 查询、TLS SNI（Server Name Indication）和流量分析三个角度讨论。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》</strong>（Kurose &amp; Ross）：自顶向下讲解网络协议栈，从应用层切入更符合直觉，配套 Wireshark 实验极具实践性。</li>\n<li><strong>《TCP/IP Illustrated, Volume 1》</strong>（W. Richard Stevens）：TCP/IP 协议的权威参考，通过抓包分析逐字节解读协议行为。</li>\n<li><strong>RFC 文档</strong>：HTTP/2（RFC 7540）、QUIC（RFC 9000）、TLS 1.3（RFC 8446）是深入理解协议设计的一手资料。</li>\n<li><strong>Beej&#39;s Guide to Network Programming</strong>：免费在线指南，用 C 语言从 Socket API 入手学习网络编程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>计算机网络的分层架构将端到端通信的复杂性分解为可管理的层次：应用层定义用户交互协议，传输层提供可靠或不可靠的端到端数据传输，网络层负责跨网路由与转发，链路层处理相邻节点间的帧传输。TCP 的拥塞控制保障了互联网在高负载下的稳定性，IP 路由协议实现了全球规模的分组交换网络。掌握这些基础概念和协议机制，是理解云计算、CDN、微服务通信和网络安全的必备前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机网络","id":"大学计算机科学与技术-计算机网络"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"应用层协议","id":"应用层协议"},{"level":3,"text":"传输层：TCP 与拥塞控制","id":"传输层-tcp-与拥塞控制"},{"level":3,"text":"网络层：IP 与路由","id":"网络层-ip-与路由"},{"level":3,"text":"链路层与局域网","id":"链路层与局域网"},{"level":3,"text":"网络安全基础","id":"网络安全基础"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 操作系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/operating-systems"},"next":{"title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机体系结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/computer-architecture"}}